{
    "2": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Flying across the windows,",
                "I met an overlord..."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wearing classic overlord clothing.",
                "With a huge red bow on her head."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Mistress Taronara would be very mad at this..."
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Unless..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "0": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How long are these damn stairs?"
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I have been flying for a while.",
                "It's starting to get Tiring!"
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "They're as long as your soul allows you to go."
            ]
        },
        "102_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The boy, whose chainsaw contains the blood of overlords",
                "Damelie Starland"
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I was joking.",
                "They're pretty, pretty long."
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Eh?",
                "Like, How long?"
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "300 Kilometers.",
                "Do you still want to continue?"
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That doesn't sounds too bad.",
                "I've been flying a lot to get in here anyways."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "\"Flying a lot to get in here...\"",
                "May I know who are you?"
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm halloween country overlord!",
                "Ruby Alinsky!"
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I came here because there's a black hole...",
                "The one over there that's gaping up my damn country."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Aaaaaaand what do you pretend to do now?"
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I pretend to beat this realm overlord's ass!",
                "That's what I pretend to do!"
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So you somehow survived at the moon garden's gate...",
                "All of that just to reach the \"Mistress\"."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Surprising.",
                "That's very gutsy of you."
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I should've expected an overlord to show up soon anyways."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait who the hell is this \"Mistress\"?"
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Makai's Overlord.",
                "She's an egocentrical vampiress who likes holidays a lot."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And you work for someone like HER?",
                "What's even the porpuse!?"
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yes, I get paid well."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The porpuse?",
                "Mistress is tired of makai's constant strange hellish feeling."
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So she decided to steal all of your holiday essence.",
                "All the way here."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You guys can live here in makai peacefully with us.",
                "Almost peacefully."
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Well If I end up stuck in here...",
                "I'll become makai's Overlord then!"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're too confident in yourself, Don't you?"
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A bit too much from someone from a country whose name",
                "is literally \"Halloween Country\" How silly."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey,",
                "that Chainsaw you have atleast makes you more powerful?"
            ]
        },
        "127_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This chainsaw was made to destroy any deity.",
                "It's Mixed blood is a curse for Hellish deities and non ones."
            ]
        },
        "128_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then, why don't you show it to me?",
                "If it's thaaaaat powerful."
            ]
        },
        "129_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Deal!",
                "In that case..."
            ]
        },
        "130_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're allowing your blood to be one more in the underworld."
            ]
        }
    },
    "1": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There you go. I got your ass."
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, Show me the way to you damn \"Mistress\"!"
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Why? It's just an straight road, don't you see?"
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You just have to fly aaaaall the way up there."
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Whatever...I'll get there."
            ]
        }
    },
    "12": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Flying across the windows,",
                "I met an overlord..."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This one Wears a classic overlord clothing.",
                "With a huge red bow on her head."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
               "Mistress Taronara would be very mad at this..."
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Unless..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "10": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Nice View of Hell you guys got here."
            ]
        },
        "100_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This is Makai's infinite path of Retribution."
            ]
        },
        "101_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The boy, whose chainsaw contains the blood of overlords",
                "Damelie Starland"
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's not really infinite. Just like 300 kilometers long.",
                "Almost nothing."
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, so I just gotta fly like, 120 kilometers more!"
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Pretty much."
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I guess you are used to long flies after all."
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But if your soul allows it,",
                "You might end in a nonstop loop in here."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Huh, What does that means?"
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Just if you grow too tired in hell...well, you might die."
            ]
        },
        "108_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Everyone in here will take advantage of your weakness."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'm from halloween country don't worry.",
                "We love this kind of stuff over there."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Halloween country you say..."
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "What's your bussiness in here, then?"
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh just Flying around looking how my new home kingdom is.",
                "You know."
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Good joke.",
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Um, sooooo where's the dinner hall here? I'm hungry."
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No holiday-overlord would accept to live in here.",
                "Ever."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Gulp, Shouldn't have said I was from halloween Country."
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I'll asume you got here from the fake moon in your country."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Let me guess, Miss Overlord."
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Trying to reach the source of the blood moon, right?",
                "Trying to reach Makai's Overlord, right?"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yeah duh!",
                "What's even your overlord's plan!?"
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Steal all holidays all for herself.",
                "She's tired of makai's constant agonizing feel."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Woah!"
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That's very egocentric.",
                "You find that cool?"
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I get well paid, Can't complain at all."
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Then, I have a very good reason to beat you and your mistress!"
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "For that, first you need to survive an Overlord assassin."
            ]
        },
        "127_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By being here...",
                "You're allowing your blood to be one more in the underworld."
            ]
        }
    },
    "11": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Your job is just to fly all around in here?",
                "Or suriviving in your job?"
            ]
        },
        "61_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Hey, it's a fun job."
            ]
        },
        "62_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Killing Overlords...and All that, ya know.",
                "Being a bounty hunter it's awesome."
            ]
        },
        "63_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Are you sure you don't want a job in Halloween?"
            ]
        },
        "64_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Anyways, I'm going."
            ]
        }
    },
    "22": {
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Flying across this mansion...",
                "I met an Cat"
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She doesn't look like she's from hell.",
                "She could be a holiday person lurking around."
            ]
        },
        "210_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Best thing To do for her would be.."
            ]
        },
        "300_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Turn back and leave immediately",
                "Unless..."
            ]
        }
    },
    "20": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How long are these stairs? Who the hell come with these ideas?"
            ]
        },
        "100_0": {
            "lines": [
                 "It's dozens of dozens of hellish kilometers long."
            ]
        },
        "101_h1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The boy, whose chainsaw contains the blood of overlords",
                "Damelie Starland"
            ]
        },
        "101_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You could continue...Or just head back like a normal cat would."
            ]
        },
        "102_0": {
            "lines": [
                "First I got a question..."
            ]
        },
        "103_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Who the hell gets the idea of making these long ass stairs?"
            ]
        },
        "104_0": {
            "lines": [
                "These stairs has been here for a while!"
            ]
        },
        "105_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Recently, Overlord Taronara reporpused them for her new plan."
            ]
        },
        "106_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Since there won't be enough space for all the holiday stuff",
                "that will end up in here."
            ]
        },
        "107_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This place is huge enough to contain all those seasons."
            ]
        },
        "109_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Wait wait wait wait.",
                "Let me get this straight..."
            ]
        },
        "110_0": {
            "lines": [
                "This \"Overlord Taronara\" wants to takeover holidays.",
                "and seasons from our world!?"
            ]
        },
        "111_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Yep, correct. Congrats, You got it first try."
            ]
        },
        "112_0": {
            "lines": [
                "And why the hell she needs to?",
                "She's already hell's overlord, Isn't that enough?"
            ]
        },
        "113_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Not for her apparently."
            ]
        },
        "114_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She's done with makai's constant repetitive dark nature.",
                "She's a brat."
            ]
        },
        "115_0": {
            "lines": [
                "I can REALLY tell."
            ]
        },
        "116_0": {
            "lines": [
                "So...How did you even got here in first place?"
            ]
        },
        "117_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Oh well! I got my ways..."
            ]
        },
        "118_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Like THAT DAMN fake moon over halloween kingdom that your",
                "Stupid Overlord opened for her stupid plan!"
            ]
        },
        "119_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're getting mad with the wrong person."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ok You know what? that's enough."
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That chainsaw you got there? you?",
                "I'm fast enough to dodge that chainsaw of yours."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ah, yes."
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Famous last words from a lot of Overlords in the past."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Ugh...."
            ]
        },
        "125_0": {
            "lines": [
                "By being here...",
                "You're allowing your blood to be one more of the underworld."
            ]
        },
        "126_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, stay in hell for all eternity! You grumpy cat girl!"
            ]
        }
    },
    "21": {
        "60_0": {
            "lines": [
                "There, I got your ass."
            ]
        },
        "120_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now, I have to fly all the way up there, right?"
            ]
        },
        "121_0": {
            "lines": [
                "You're correct."
            ]
        },
        "122_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No one, can survive the Horrible energy up there."
            ]
        },
        "123_0": {
            "lines": [
                "It's horrorifying, specially for you holiday people.",
                "Being so used to happy song and all that crap."
            ]
        },
        "124_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Meeeeeeeeeh, How bad could it be."
            ]
        }
    }
}